n testing has been carried out in the MATLAB-interfaced OPAL-RT experimental setup. Finally, the optimum results obtained from the proposed approaches are confirmed by relating the same to some recently published frequency regulation outcomes in a benchmark power system model. It is observed that the i-MSA-based FO-T2F-PID method delivers advancement in microgrid frequency control compared to recent research outcomes. © 2022 Taylor & Francis Group, LLC.},
