ng conclusion arose: The steam agent emerged as the most suitable, with 48% exergy efficiency, 1.77 €/kg LCOH, and an optimal temperature of 884°C. Notably, steam showcased remarkable exergy efficiency, even when subjected to lower temperatures, positioning it as a superior choice. © 2024},
